\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{3}{\textbf {GMC-Link pipeline.} Consecutive frames feed an ORB homography estimate; transforms compose into a cumulative homography that yields a 13D residual-velocity descriptor; a two-tower encoder aligns the descriptor with the referring expression; the alignment score corrects the host logit through additive fusion, and the result is scored by HOTA}{figure.caption.4}{}}
