\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Component ablation in moving-class HOTA (the metric pooled scores dilute), iKUN host, $n{=}5$ seeds (mean$\,\pm \,$std). Against the native host (20.25), the full module recovers $+8.83$; ego-compensation is the only component whose removal costs a significant amount ($-1.77$, Welch $p{=}0.006$), while collapsing the temporal scales or removing snr fall within the seed spread.}}{6}{table.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:ablation}{{4}{6}{Component ablation in moving-class HOTA (the metric pooled scores dilute), iKUN host, $n{=}5$ seeds (mean$\,\pm \,$std). Against the native host (20.25), the full module recovers $+8.83$; ego-compensation is the only component whose removal costs a significant amount ($-1.77$, Welch $p{=}0.006$), while collapsing the temporal scales or removing snr fall within the seed spread}{table.caption.8}{}}
